{"schema_version":1,"key":"dish-f20a63e1bd7e","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-f20a63e1bd7e","name":"黔式腊肠娃娃菜","category":"meat_dish","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/meat_dish/%E9%BB%94%E5%BC%8F%E8%85%8A%E8%82%A0%E5%A8%83%E5%A8%83%E8%8F%9C/%E9%BB%94%E5%BC%8F%E8%85%8A%E8%82%A0%E5%A8%83%E5%A8%83%E8%8F%9C.md","blob_sha":"5c84be631f024e0ea2263f12a14d96ae27fad172","details":{"introduction":"这道菜咸鲜可口，融合了黔式腊肠的醇香与娃娃菜的清甜，是西南菜系中少见的不辣风味，南北皆宜。娃娃菜富含维生素和膳食纤维，搭配腊肠的蛋白质与脂肪，营养均衡。制作过程极为简单，无需掌握火候和额外调味，从备料到出锅仅需 15 分钟，非常适合新手和忙碌的日常。","difficulty":"★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"- 黔式腊肠\n- 娃娃菜"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"按照 1 人的份量：\n\n- 黔式腊肠 200g\n- 娃娃菜 300g\n- 水 750ml"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"1. 锅内放入 750ml 水，开火加热至沸腾\n2. 放入腊肠，计时 13 分钟\n3. 放入娃娃菜，计时 2 分钟\n4. 关火，夹出腊肠及娃娃菜\n5. 娃娃菜切段、腊肠切片，装盘"},{"heading":"附加内容","markdown":"- 根据锅的大小，建议以水量没过食材为宜，宁多勿少\n- 如果没有刀具，娃娃菜和腊肠不切也可以"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"unknown","basis":null,"serving_g":null,"scope":null,"per_100g":{"energy_kcal":null,"protein_g":null,"carbohydrate_g":null,"fat_g":null},"source":null},"nutrition_profiles":[{"id":"family-f20a63e1bd7e-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-f20a63e1bd7e","recipe_blob_sha":"5c84be631f024e0ea2263f12a14d96ae27fad172","version":"1","data_version":"6ff5169dba129121","status":"reference","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","estimate_confidence":"low","final_weight":{"grams":650,"method":"household_recipe_assumption","basis":"standard_recipe_assumption","is_measured":false,"servings":{"min":2,"max":3},"evidence":"项目按2–3人家庭份明确设定成品650g，非实测或USDA出成率；原料与成品重分别保存。"},"retention_correction":"not_applied","basis":"per_100g","completeness":"complete","scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：VENUS中式腊肠180g、大白菜500g、饮用水100g；整份约650g。明确VENUS中式甜腊肠替代黔式腊肠的限定变体，品牌风味与盐脂有差异；不用此结果冒充黔式所有产品；整份菜汤油脂全部食用。限定品牌：VENUS中式腊肠=VENUS GTIN 032971301886。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-f20a63e1bd7e","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"simmer","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":false,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":false,"brand":"VENUS中式腊肠=VENUS GTIN 032971301886","variant":"family-f20a63e1bd7e-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"sausage_branded","grams":180},{"key":"napa","grams":500},{"key":"water","grams":100}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、丢弃汤汁或锅中残油的实际摄入计算","将家庭份成品重量假设当作实测或USDA出成率"]},"per_100g":{"energy_kcal":147.169231,"protein_g":6.018462,"carbohydrate_g":4.669538,"fat_g":11.812308},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/2618479/nutrients","version":"6ff5169dba129121","fdc_ids":[2618479,169979,173647]},"rules_version":"nutrition-1.6.0","is_estimate":true,"requires_independent_match":true,"details":{"path":"assets/nutrition/family-f20a63e1bd7e-v1.e3c91111ec936197.json","bytes":18760,"sha256":"e3c91111ec9361978041eed98af349c0ee19f8033f89763e5f942b965c22f25f"}}]}
